  noteTitle: 'Portier Log 3/4 Warehouse Check:'
  noteContent: Checked the Warehouse as scheduled. All crates and cabinets locked
    up, just like the Dean ordered after the last "inventory". Nothing's changed.
    I heard a rumor the Dean has some kind of universal card that supposedly opens
    everything. Maybe even that new, locked panel by the exit? Interesting...
